This firmware is based on AirGradient Arduino library 3.7.0
(https://github.com/airgradienthq/arduino), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.

Humidity and temperature come from an optional DHT22 / AM2302 when
wired, otherwise from the Open-Meteo forecast API
(https://open-meteo.com/).

The local web portal, Plantower duty-cycle settings, Open-Meteo
location picker, optional DHT22 path, and ESP8266 NodeMCU + PMS5003
packaging are additions for this DIY project.
